      "EMILY & FRIEND: Fourth word.\nEMILY: Ape! Gorilla!",
      "JANE: Hooray for Mommy!\nRUTH: ... Hooray for Mommy.",
      "RUTH: Hi. Jane.\nJANE: Hey, mom.",
      "RUTH: These kids are so passionate. To them it’s about more than precedents and dissents. They want to forge a movement. Mmm. This is delicious.\nRUTH: Hold on Jane. We need to have a talk. I got a call from her school today. Apparently I mis-dated a note excusing you from classes last week?\nJANE: It’s not a big deal.",
      "RUTH: You skipped school. It’s the first week. Is this what this year’s going to be like? You lied to--\nJANE: I never lied.\nRUTH: Forging a note IS lying, Jane. You’re smart enough to know that.\nJANE: Apparently I’m not, Mom."
    ]
